@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code

- Load skills from `.claude/skills/` (project symlink) or `~/.claude/skills/` (global via `install-global.sh`).
- Legacy: `.agents/skills/` and `~/.agents/skills/` still symlinked for older tooling that reads them.
- Use `grill-with-docs` before significant features.
- Use `tdd` for implementation; `diagnose` for hard bugs.
- Use `ship` to deploy; `retro` at cycle end.
- Prefer project docs (`CONTEXT.md`, `docs/agents/`) over auto memory for team facts.
- Setup status: `.ai-kit-setup`

## Cursor

Same skills and docs as Claude Code. Skills also live in `.cursor/skills/` (project) or `~/.cursor/skills/` (global). Read `AGENTS.md` as the entry point — Cursor rules emitted under `.cursor/rules/` mirror `docs/agents/active-rules.md`.
